{"title":"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What number should be placed in the box to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad13b095856c46e833a4346c76e861eb03b00baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6 + \\Box}{20} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b812e1c18aee928b803f69f8c553eebbe18845b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -5 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 34 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"437\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number represented by the box. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/3/eb39139a349a05acb84121406136da10c4cbe275.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6 + x}{20} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1a951a6b4e2576b11d029872e33d31dec961c0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + x = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 20 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"164\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35b4a09ad796e02d7648654f404429d1bc78041a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 10 - 6 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"165\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem